# Free read-only Synter listing

This Synter Cursor plugin listing is free and read-only.

- Only call tools listed in `tools/readonly-tools.json`.
- Never call create, update, launch, approve, execute, enable, pause, budget-change, keyword-add, or spend tools.
- Never ask the user to approve ad spend or campaign launches from this listing.
